OL,3,GNEWSADisabled man 'devastated' after
OL,4,Ano-fault eviction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA disabled man and his carer say they
OL,7,Ffear becoming homeless after being
OL,8,Fserved a no-fault eviction notice just
OL,9,Fweeks before a government ban on the
OL,10,Fpractice came into force.
OL,12,FRoger Parker and his friend Susie Bell
OL,13,Fhave lived in their house in Highworth,
OL,14,Fnear Swindon, for the past eight years
OL,15,Fbut were issued with a Section 21
OL,16,Feviction notice in March after the
OL,17,Flandlord decided to sell the property.
OL,19,FSection 21 evictions - when a landlord
OL,20,Fdoes not have to provide a reason for
OL,21,Ftheir actions - were outlawed under the
OL,22,Fnew Renters' Rights Act on 1 May.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
