OL,3,GNEWSADisabled man 'devastated' after
OL,4,Ano-fault eviction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA government spokesperson acknowledged
OL,7,F"how distressing no-fault evictions can
OL,8,Fbe" but said new laws meant they
OL,9,F"cannot happen again".
